  bootwright / schema
      Export the advisory schema of every desired-state kind. The export states types, required
      fields, closed field sets, enum values and numeric bounds; bootwright validate stays the
      authority on lexical grammars, references and cross-field rules.

  Usage
    bootwright schema [flags]

  Command flags
      --format  Select the schema format (values: json-schema) (required)

  Common flags
      --ascii       Use ASCII status markers
      --color       Select terminal colors (values: auto, always, never) · default auto
      --detail      Select human detail (values: compact, full) · default compact
      -h, --help    Show help for this command
      -o, --output  Select output mode (values: text, json, yaml) · default text
      --progress    Select progress animation (values: auto, always, never) · default auto
      --width       Set presentation width (0: automatic) · default 0

  Examples
    bootwright schema --format json-schema
